msgstr "Fekvő"

#: includes/elements/pro-forms/ProForms.php:6729
msgid "Select the orientation of your PDF."
msgstr "Válaszd ki a PDF tájolását."

#: includes/elements/pro-forms/ProForms.php:6736
msgid "PDF Name"
msgstr "PDF neve"

#: includes/elements/pro-forms/ProForms.php:6738
msgid ""
"Enter the name of your PDF. You can use form field IDs or dynamic data as "
"well. At the end of the name, a timestamp will be added to ensure that the "
"PDF is unique."
msgstr "Add meg a PDF nevét. Űrlapmező-azonosítókat vagy dinamikus adatokat is használhatsz. A név végére időbélyeg kerül, hogy a PDF egyedi legyen."

#: includes/elements/pro-forms/ProForms.php:6745
